Old World test branch update 1.0.85540 Test 2026-11-18

Programming

Pathfinder improvements

UI

Added map visualizer to single player setup screens. Click 'Map Preview' to see an example map using the currently selected settings, and select 'Use this Map' if you would like to play on this exact map
Added potential bonuses link to specialist tooltips (requires Advanced Help option)
Improved yield format consistency in specialist and some other helptext

Bugs Fixed

Fixed discard pile techs sometimes bypassing the draw pile when they shouldn’t
Fixed map scrolling lag when not using High Rendering setting
Fixed free improvement placement overlay not appearing until selection is cleared
Fixed cloud game list not refreshing correctly after deleting game
Fixed regents being counted for cognomen legitimacy decay
Ffixed incorrect Player Screen law row spacing with many laws
Fixed Mourning trait not being removed on death
Fixed Patrons helptext inconsistency
Fixed leader reign text for dead rightful heirs
Fixed eliminated players remaining on player screen
Fixed Learn to Play scenario 4 bug when trying to settle 4th city on island
Text and event fixes
